Type: Package
Package: gtfsrt2static
Title: Realized Static GTFS Snapshots from GTFS-Realtime and GPS-Derived
    Observations
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Egor", "Kotov", , "kotov.egor@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6690-5345"))
Description: Converts archived GTFS-Realtime feeds ('Trip Updates',
    'Vehicle Positions') and GPS-derived observations into
    standard-compliant static GTFS snapshots that describe public transit
    service as actually operated. Provides a canonical observed-stop-events
    table that both input paths converge on, an assembler that merges
    observations into a baseline static feed or scaffolds a compliant feed
    from scratch, and a lightweight collector for continuously archiving
    ephemeral GTFS-Realtime endpoints.
